<title>UK: LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</title>
<headline>LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, Reuter - Following are the buying and selling rates for leading world currencies and gold against the dollar on the London foreign exchange and bullion markets today.</p>
<p>US$1.00 COSTS    1.3905/10  Canadian Dollars</p>
<p>		     1.8400/10  German Marks</p>
<p>		     2.0719/34  Dutch Guilders</p>
<p>		     1.5180/90  Swiss Francs</p>
<p>		     37.99/00   Belgian Francs</p>
<p>		     6.2030/60  French Francs</p>
<p>		     1798.0/8.5 Italian Lire</p>
<p>		     117.80/85  Japanese Yen</p>
<p>		     8.0213/90  Swedish Crowns</p>
<p>		     7.6227/77  Norwegian Crowns</p>
<p>		     7.0104/14  Danish Crowns</p>
<p>One sterling     US$1.5916/26</p>
<p>Gold (ounce)     US$324.00/50</p>
</text>
